    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No weight loss, fever, or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Breast</td><td>Positive</td><td>Left breast lump with a small bruise from the biopsy; no nipple discharge or skin change</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bone or back pain; knee stiffness unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No epigastric pain, black stools, or vomiting</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Worried and sleeping less since the biopsy; PHQ-9 6, GAD-7 8</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

